      'Li, Tongshu, et al. “Research Insights on “Problematic Use of Short Video”: A Comprehensive Review Exploration in Psychological Context.” Addiction Biology, vol. 30, no. 11, 1 Nov. 2025, pp. e70082–e70082, https://doi.org/10.1111/adb.70082. Accessed 23 Nov. 2025.',
      'Mao, Minghua, and Feng Liao. “Undergraduates Short Form Video Addiction and Learning Burnout Association Involving Anxiety Symptoms and Coping Styles Moderation.” Scientific Reports, vol. 15, no. 1, 7 July 2025, https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-025-09656-x.',
