      'Su, Conghui, et al. “Viewing Personalized Video Clips Recommended by TikTok Activates Default Mode Network and Ventral Tegmental Area.” NeuroImage, vol. 237, no. 118136, 15 Aug. 2021, p. 118136, https://doi.org/10.1016/j.neuroimage.2021.118136.',
      'Tagliaferri, Ginevra, et al. “Connected by Boredom: A Systematic Review of the Role of Trait Boredom in Problematic Technology Use.” Brain Sciences, vol. 15, no. 8, Aug. 2025, p. 794, https://doi.org/10.3390/brainsci15080794.',
      'Wang, Lan, et al. “Fear of Missing out (FOMO) Associates with Reduced Cortical Thickness in Core Regions of the Posterior Default Mode Network and Higher Levels of Problematic Smartphone and Social Media Use.” Addictive Behaviors, vol. 143, 1 Aug. 2023, p. 107709, https://doi.org/10.1016/j.addbeh.2023.107709. Accessed 19 May 2023.',
